    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so permanent. like no matter what i do, or how much i try to \"live,\" the grayness is just waiting for me. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. it's like i'm stuck in this loop and there's no way out of the numbness.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
